<title>DENMARK: Coloplast full year 1995/96 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Coloplast full year 1995/96 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to September 30,1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result			184.8 vs 150.5</p>
<p> Group pre-tax result		  270.4 vs 210.9</p>
<p> Group net turnover	    1.974.5 bln vs 1.683.7 bln  Result per share (crowns)	     4.5 vs 3.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Danish medical group is Coloplast A/S . It said in a statement that it expected a 10 percent better pre-tax result in whole year 1996/97 than in 1995/96. The result was below average analyst expectations of a 276 million crown pre-tax profit. --Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-96</p>
</text>
